terventions during these periods. Offenses)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 202.08 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (such as uninsured driving and intoxicated driving further heighten risks, while vulnerable groups, including adults)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 189.41 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (aged 31€60 and older adults, require focused attention.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 165.16 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (While these findings provide valuable insights, it is important to acknowledge certain limitations in the analysis.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 152.49 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (Potential gaps or unknown factors within the dataset, such as population density, driver behavior, and unreported)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 139.82 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (incidents, may influence observed patterns, making it difficult to establish direct causation. These limitations should)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 127.15 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (be considered when interpreting the findings and implementing recommendations to ensure a balanced and)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 114.48 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (realistic approach to improving road safety.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 90.23 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (The insights derived from this analysis highlight the importance of improved road design, stricter enforcement of)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 77.56 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (traffic laws, and tailored awareness campaigns to address specific risk areas. By focusing on high-risk provinces, road)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 0.216 rg BT 0.00 64.89 Td /TT0 10.34 Tf (types, and driver behaviors, traffic safety can be significantly enhanced.)Tj ET Q q /GS0 gs 0.165 0.188 0.216 RG 0.165 0.188 